    <div class="card">

        <p class="updated">
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 29, 2026
        </p>

        <p>
            This Privacy Policy explains how Tower Rush Builder
            handles information when you use the Tower Rush Builder
            mobile game.
        </p>

        <h2>1. About Tower Rush Builder</h2>

        <p>
            Tower Rush Builder is a casual mobile game created for
            entertainment. Users can play the game, build towers,
            earn virtual in-game rewards, and interact with the
            game's features.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
            Tower Rush Builder does not directly ask users to provide
            sensitive personal information such as passwords,
            government identification numbers, or financial account
            information.
        </p>

        <p>
            Depending on the features and services used by the game,
            certain technical information may be processed by
            third-party services used by the application.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Advertising</h2>

        <p>
            Tower Rush Builder uses Google AdMob to display
            advertisements.
        </p>

        <p>
            Google AdMob may collect and process information such as
            advertising identifiers, device information, approximate
            location, and information about interactions with
            advertisements, subject to Google's applicable policies.
        </p>

        <p>
            The game may display banner advertisements and
            interstitial advertisements.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Google AdMob</h2>

        <p>
            Google AdMob is a third-party advertising service
            provided by Google. AdMob may use information collected
            through its advertising services to provide, measure,
            personalize, and improve advertisements, subject to
            applicable settings and policies.
        </p>

        <p>
            For more information about Google's privacy practices,
            please visit:
        </p>

        <p>
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Google Privacy Policy
            </a>
        </p>

        <h2>5. Advertising Identifier</h2>

        <p>
            The game may use the Android Advertising ID through
            Google advertising services. The availability and use of
            advertising identifiers may depend on the user's device
            settings and applicable platform policies.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Game Data</h2>

        <p>
            Tower Rush Builder may store game-related information
            such as scores, settings, gameplay progress, and virtual
            coins, depending on the features implemented in the
            application.
        </p>

        <p>
            Virtual coins and other virtual rewards used in the game
            are virtual game items. They have no real-world monetary
            value and are not intended to represent real currency.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
            The application may use third-party services, including
            advertising services, to support app functionality and
            display advertisements.
        </p>

        <p>
            These third-party services may process information in
            accordance with their own privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Data Security</h2>

        <p>
            We take reasonable measures to protect information
            handled by the application. However, no method of
            electronic storage or transmission is completely secure,
            and absolute security cannot be guaranteed.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>

        <p>
            Tower Rush Builder does not knowingly request sensitive
            personal information from children.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you believe that a child has provided personal
            information through the application, please contact us
            using the email address below.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
            When changes are made, the updated version will be
            published on this page and the effective date will be
            updated.
        </p>

